================================================   |  96%\n  |                                                                            \n  |====================================================================  |  97%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================================================================== |  98%\n  |                                                                            \n  |===================================================================== |  99%\n  |                                                                            \n  |======================================================================| 100%\n```\n\n\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsetdiff(pov_2010$GEOID, pov_2017$GEOID)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\ncharacter(0)\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
